WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:06.045
Use place value and doubling: multiplying by 20 is multiplying by 2 and then by 10.

00:00:06.867 --> 00:00:16.196
Work out 94 times 20 using an efficient method. The answer is 1880. 94 times 20

00:00:16.196 --> 00:00:17.363
equals 1880.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:23.726
A project on a football field has 44 units in each of 5 sets. What is the total?

00:00:23.726 --> 00:00:25.261
